{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3852230/extras/78553c7e077aaba02893432a92677dae.avif?t=1767193988\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3852230/extras_big/78553c7e077aaba02893432a92677dae.avif?t=1767193988 width=800 height=133 /></span>The wicked lizards have come once again to cause mayhem and snatch away the kingdom's damsels. Let them know no mercy\u2014help fight the lizards back and rescue the beautiful princess!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Click Your Way to Victory Against the Invaders of Mother Russia</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a visual novel with clicker and RPG elements. No time for walls of text! Become the Mari bogatyr, Elaviy the Stouthearted, and show the invaders of Mother Russia what you\u2019re made of!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Turn Loot into Equipment</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Acquire the best armor and weapons from defeated enemies. Forge powerful amulets from the rest to deal with even the greatest of threats!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Dive into a Slavic Folktale</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take a journey filled with humor, authentic heroic spirit, charismatic characters, and cinematic vistas. All alongside a powerful soundtrack that will have you wanting to battle the lizards time and time again.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Endless Battles</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After completing the story, step into endless mode. Even more new enemies \u2014 new battles every time. Discover who you truly are and become the bravest bogatyr.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3852230/extras/0094b9d5c5015045de06202e9bd11733.avif?t=1767193988\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3852230/extras_big/0094b9d5c5015045de06202e9bd11733.avif?t=1767193988 width=800 height=133 /></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Princess Rescue","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3852230/d8c4e7b1bd2f925345943b1422df970e6050933c.jpg"},{"name":"First Gear","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3852230/33f689b7cf1d64992626c02ea034a95b904b4841.jpg"},{"name":"My Precious","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3852230/d871d46d53badcdb6dc94bc30abbd9831fe4d2e1.jpg"},{"name":"Shirtless Wonder","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3852230/de3592c58c3deaff1ae8a84651a9bfd84413a2d8.jpg"},{"name":"Unstoppable Charge","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3852230/64340d35c93df4f25a46fc6e59b9d92f003e15f6.jpg"},{"name":"Last Gulp","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3852230/5277f13689a2daa7cd360b19f834a2c5c54cded9.jpg"},{"name":"Junk Collector","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3852230/7e9a381ba6936e926db81d18caca845cfb37eba5.jpg"},{"name":"Cook","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3852230/beb4bd6d3d2b89cce082cc4ad324c8adb8043d30.jpg"},{"name":"Steadfast Bogatyr","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3852230/55ed304de89bd6ff1066ac572edee3bf1a8d635c.jpg"}],"total":9},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3852230?t=1767193988","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3852230/dbe46636817dd71bae3786b6508800c5119c022e/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1767193988","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3852230/0d2916e58178bc983b15338f0caadc0bd2c07ab4/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1767193988","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/stea