ck that will have you wanting to battle the lizards time and time again.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Endless Battles</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After completing the story, step into endless mode. Even more new enemies \u2014 new battles every time. Discover who you truly are and become the bravest bogatyr.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3852230/extras/0094b9d5c5015045de06202e9bd11733.avif?t=1767193988\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3852230/extras_big/0094b9d5c5015045de06202e9bd11733.avif?t=1767193988 width=800 height=133 /></span></p>","developers":["RUzura Interactive"],"dlc":[4060240],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3852230/30719031dc459927fc745eb02ffd5fb330f5c346/header.jpg?t=1767193988","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3852230/1688574724/fd9010cf5df5408b79467cdd2787e1d8efb7316f/1761740693/dash_av1.mpd?t=1761741531","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3852230/1688574724/fd9010cf5df5408b79467cdd2787e1d8efb7316f/1761740693/dash_h264.mpd?t=1761741531","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3852230/1688574724/fd9010cf5df5408b79467cdd2787e1d8efb7316f/1761740693/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1761741531","id":257224128,"name":"\u041f\u0443\u0442\u044c \u0431\u043e\u0433\u0430\u0442\u044b\